<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>My entertainment is the church; all the dear saints, my family.</l><l>Here gladly I will spend my all; grace is sufficient and will increase.</l><l>O Jesus, Jesus, fill me up every moment,</l><l>Let me enjoy Your lovely self so sweet as my complete supply.</l><l>O Jesus, Jesus, fill me up every moment,</l><l>Let me enjoy Your lovely self so sweet as my complete supply.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If there’s “church life” without the cross, it’s false—reject it utterly.</l><l>The old creation we cast off; divine life sprouts, transforming our being.</l><l>O Jesus Jesus, illumine me continually.</l><l>Let me be lost in Thee, O holy Light, from all sin’s bondage set free.</l><l>Give strength, new life, releasing me from anxiety.</l><l>Let me enjoy Your lovely self so sweet, as my complete supply.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
